                <note rend="inline" type="source">819.001 Alfaro, Ricardo J./4: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Panama</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Davis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Panama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-01-17T10:00:00-05:00">January 17, 1931—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 11:20 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>33. Department’s telegram No. 12, January 15, noon. Alfaro was inaugurated
                    yesterday at 4 p.m. I attended inauguration.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
